    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一緒に並んでくれてありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "038"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "これくらいお安い御用だよっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040140030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえば甘奈はここのプリン、食べられたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、この前友達と一緒に食べたんだ～\r\nめっちゃ美味しかったよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから、プロデューサーさんにも\r\n早く食べてもらいたいな～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈のおかげでそれが叶うんだな──\r\nお、そろそろ俺たちの番だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "ご来店ありがとうございます\r\n限定プリンでよろしいでしょうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "はーい、お願いしま～す☆",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "かしこまりました、ただいまご用意します\r\n限定プリン用のシュガーはお付けしますか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "？　そんなのあるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "はい、コーヒーフレーバーのもので\r\nプリンによく合うんですよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……コーヒーフレーバー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "カップルの方限定でお付けしていますので\r\nよければぜひどうぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_trouble",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ああ、いえ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "──あ！　ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_trouble",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0327",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "付き合ってます……から……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "はい、かしこまりました\r\n……ふふっ、なんだか、初々しいですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "まだ、付き合いたてなので……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "そうなんですね～！\r\nでは、ご用意いたしますので少々お待ちください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……その……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……ごめんなさい……つい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今かぶってる仮装用のフード\r\nもう少し深くかぶれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきは甘奈だってばれなかったみたいだけど\r\n少し間違えたら危なかったからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、俺が楽しみにしてた気持ち\r\n察してくれたんだよな、ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008110240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "！\r\n……うん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400811/2014008110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "お待たせしました！　こちらになります",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……と、こっちが甘奈の分だな、はい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
